#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:9
msgid "Optional storage, IPC, frames and F407 handoff"
msgstr "Optional storage, IPC, frames and F407 handoff"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:11
msgid ""
"Public generic mechanisms are separate from concrete MCU adapters. Current "
"production integration is F4; retired H5/H7/U5 adapters are not selected "
"merely because their vendor libraries remain in the repository. Physical HIL "
"is not executed and source presence does not create a software candidate."
msgstr ""
"Public generic mechanisms are separate from concrete MCU adapters. Current "
"production integration is F4; retired H5/H7/U5 adapters are not selected "
"merely because their vendor libraries remain in the repository. Physical HIL "
"is not executed and source presence does not create a software candidate."

